# PocketLedger environment-variable reference
# No environment variables are consumed by the current bootstrap.
# Installing, type-checking, and running the starter require no .env file.
#
# Later tickets will define the API/database variables and loading behavior.
# Placeholder examples only; commented out because they are not usable values:
# DATABASE_URL=<development-only-postgresql-connection-string>
# SESSION_SECRET=<generate-locally-when-authentication-is-implemented>
#
# Never put real credentials here, even when they are development credentials.
# Never use EXPO_PUBLIC_ for secrets: those values are visible to app users.
